Subject: [PATCH 02/16] feat(client): the settings module - hand-written
 key=value config with safe defaults (PLAN-M10.2 3.4)

config.rs: the seven-key Settings struct (edge_scroll, pan_speed,
zoom_min, zoom_max, master_volume [Phase 4 placeholder], fullscreen,
debug_overlay), a hand-rolled parser/serializer (no serde, no new
crates - the allow-list is untouched), per-key salvage on malformed
values (A-108), range clamping, and std-env config-dir resolution
(XDG / HOME / APPDATA, persistence silently disabled when neither
exists - A-109). App loads the settings at startup and the camera
pan speed now reads pan_speed instead of the hardcoded constant.
Round-trip, corrupt-file, unknown-key, clamping, and dir-resolution
tests (13 new).
