From d36f23a07d23bcc3ec9d3fba427ef4410ec332ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elieaazzam-art <elieaazzam-art@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 20:52:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/16] feat(client): the application state machine - screens,
 focus, effects, all pure (PLAN-M10.2 3.1)

screens.rs: AppState (screen + keyboard focus) with the plan's full
diagram - MainMenu -> (Settings | NewMatch) -> InMatch -> (PauseMenu |
EndScreen) -> MainMenu - as pure transitions returning (state, effect)
pairs. Effects are the app-layer vocabulary (StartMatch, RestartMatch,
DropMatch, Pause/Unpause, SaveSettings, AdjustSetting, QuitApp).
Settings remembers where it was opened from; the New Match screen owns
its fields (mode cycles Player vs AI / AI vs AI spectate / Sandbox,
the seed field types digits and randomizes on Enter - A-111's random
path is a caller-supplied input so tests pin it, map index wraps the
bundle count); focus wraps (A-110); Esc backs out one level per screen
(no Escape rung on the end screen - an explicit choice is required).
28 unit tests: every diagram edge, back-navigation, settings
return-memory, focus movement, activation, seed editing, mode
semantics (spectate silences human orders). No winit types inside.
The wiring lands in the next commits.
