phase's exit test, DEBT-008 recipe): keyboard alone navigates menu ->
New Match -> Start (700-frame run, match ongoing at tick 216); mouse
alone does the same by clicking the rendered rows (tick 217); spectate
(Right cycles the Mode row) and Sandbox both start and run their
matches. All through the real wgpu GL path under llvmpipe.
