From: elieaazzam-art <elieaazzam-art@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:59:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/16] feat(client): the pause menu and the Escape ladder's
 reworked final rung (PLAN-M10.2 3.5)

Esc's exhausted rung opens the pause menu instead of quitting the
application (an accidental Esc with nothing selected used to cost the
player their window). The earlier rungs - cancel armed, cancel
placement, clear selection - stay exactly as Phase 1 re-tested them;
only the final rung changes and the rung test pins the new name. The
pause menu itself (Resume / Settings / Restart / Quit to Menu) renders
through the menu pass over the paused match; opening it force-pauses
through the existing MatchHost pause and Resume/Escape unpause (P
stays a direct toggle - the brief's pick, A-114). Both control cards
(README + PLAYTEST) carry the new ladder and the menus paragraph in
this commit.
---
 README.md                    | 15 +++++++++++----
 crates/client/src/input.rs   | 18 +++++++++++++-----
 crates/client/src/main.rs    | 10 +++++++++-
 crates/client/src/screens.rs |  4 ----
 docs/PLAYTEST.md             | 15 +++++++++++++--
 5 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

